clearcote(#15): serve the capture stencil masks until the context writes stencil state

The four GL stencil masks are MUTABLE state, not capability limits, so they are served
from the persona only while the page has not written stencil state -- after that
getParameter reports the real values and set-then-read cannot disagree. Present in the
shipped r19 binary but carried by no patch.

